  questionID: Q1
  questionText: "Who is the hero depicted in the image of the village of Ng\xE0 uprooting
    bamboo to drive away the Yin invaders?"
  answers:
  - "Th\u1EA1ch Sanh"
  - "Th\xE1nh Gi\xF3ng"
  - "S\u01A1n Tinh"
  - "S\u1ECD D\u1EEBa"
  correctAnswerIndex: 0
  answerFeedbacks:
  - "Wrong! Th\u1EA1ch Sanh is a hero who killed the ogre and rescued the princess,
    not someone who fought against the Yin invaders."
  - Exactly! Phu Dong Thien Vuong (Thanh Giong) is one of the Four Immortals, a symbol
    of strength against foreign invaders.
  - Wrong! Son Tinh is the lord of the highlands, the one who defeated Thuy Tinh
    to win Mi Nuong.
  - Wrong! Coconut Shell is a fairy tale character with a bizarre appearance but
    exceptional talent.
  difficultyTier: 1
